# Bring-your-own legacy inputs and reference media
#
# These files may be copyrighted, private, very large, or all three. Keep them
# in ignored local directories or outside the repository, and record only hashes
# and factual observations in docs when they are used as research evidence.
# The root ad directory holds local After Dark copies for testing, including
# supporting files regardless of extension. Never commit its contents.
